00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:12.410
But yeah, that works.

00:31:12.410 --> 00:31:13.160
It doesn't matter.

00:31:13.160 --> 00:31:14.504
It still works as a metaphor.

00:31:14.504 --> 00:31:16.170
FRANCESC CAMPOY: I'd
say on the train is

00:31:16.170 --> 00:31:17.450
